  "description": "Optional Temporal-backed durable execution backend for the SmooAI.SmoothOperator.Core agent engine (ADR-030). An agent turn runs as a Temporal workflow whose model call and each tool invocation are activities, giving crash-safe resume, durable human-in-the-loop via signals, and durable timers. The in-process executor runs the same drive_turn loop inline — one loop, two backends. The C# sibling of the Rust smooai-smooth-operator-temporal crate.",
